{%- comment -%}
  sidebar-collection.bwt — ngăn Bộ lọc (collection + search). M-24 (17/11/2026): 100% Tailwind, dùng chung 2 trang (trước: <aside> chép ở 2 template).
  Mobile (< 992px): ngăn kéo trượt từ trái (translate 300ms, tắt khi giảm chuyển động), đầu = tiêu đề + nút X cùng 1 hàng, ruột cuộn, chân cố định "Thiết lập lại" + "Tìm kiếm".
  Desktop: cột trái như cũ (tiêu đề + "Xóa tất cả"). Móc JS (col.js, không CSS): left-content (+ .active), close-filters, [data-filter-reset].
  Tham số: quote (true ⇒ in settings.collection_sidebar_quote cuối cột lọc — chỉ trang danh mục).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pc_sb_title = settings.collection_filter_heading | default: 'Bộ lọc sản phẩm' | escape -%}
<aside class="left-content flex min-w-0 flex-col font-sans min-[992px]:sticky min-[992px]:top-24 max-[991px]:fixed max-[991px]:inset-y-0 max-[991px]:left-0 max-[991px]:z-[99999] max-[991px]:w-5/6 max-[991px]:max-w-sm max-[991px]:-translate-x-full max-[991px]:bg-white max-[991px]:transition-transform max-[991px]:duration-300 motion-reduce:transition-none max-[991px]:[&.active]:translate-x-0" aria-label="{{ pc_sb_title }}">
	<div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-between gap-3 border-0 border-b border-solid border-line-soft py-1 pl-4 pr-1 min-[992px]:hidden">
		<p class="m-0 text-base font-bold text-brand-deep">{{ pc_sb_title }}</p>
		<button type="button" class="close-filters flex h-[44px] w-[44px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-ink" aria-label="Đóng bộ lọc">{% include 'ui_icon', name: 'x', size: 24, label: '' %}</button>
	</div>
	{%- comment -%} section-box-bg: lớp bọc CŨ giữ tạm cho ruột bộ lọc + menu danh mục (aside-cate chưa chuyển Tailwind). {%- endcomment -%}
	<div class="section-box-bg min-h-0 flex-1 max-[991px]:overflow-y-auto max-[991px]:p-4 min-[992px]:rounded-2xl min-[992px]:border min-[992px]:border-solid min-[992px]:border-line min-[992px]:bg-white min-[992px]:p-4">
		{%- if settings.aside_category_enable -%}
		{%- include 'aside-cate' -%}
		{%- endif -%}
		{%- if settings.aside_filter_enable -%}
		<div class="mb-2 hidden items-center justify-between gap-3 min-[992px]:flex">
			<p class="m-0 text-base font-bold text-ink">{{ pc_sb_title }}</p>
			<button type="button" class="min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-sm font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4" data-filter-reset>{{ settings.collection_filter_clear_label | default: 'Xóa tất cả' | escape }}</button>
		</div>
		{%- include 'aside-filter' -%}
		{%- endif -%}
	</div>
	{%- if settings.aside_filter_enable -%}
	<div class="flex shrink-0 gap-2 border-0 border-t border-solid border-line-soft bg-white p-3 min-[992px]:hidden">
		<button type="button" class="min-h-[44px] flex-1 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-solid border-primary bg-transparent px-3 text-sm font-bold text-brand-deep transition-colors hover:bg-brand-tint" data-filter-reset>{{ settings.collection_filter_reset_label | default: 'Thiết lập lại' | escape }}</button>
		<button type="button" data-filter-apply class="min-h-[44px] flex-1 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-0 bg-btn px-3 text-sm font-bold text-btn-text transition-colors hover:bg-btn-hover">{{ settings.collection_filter_apply_label | default: 'Tìm kiếm' | escape }}</button>
	</div>
	{%- endif -%}
</aside>
